  "title": "Great Grandma&#39;s Nut Butter Balls",
  "description": "My great grandma&#39;s recipe (duh). The combination of confectioners&#39; sugar and cake flour makes them really melt in your mouth. Don&#39;t try to double unless you&#39;ve got a really big mixer!",
  "authors": [
